276	https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wk8.jpg	2026-08-31 07:12:34.931538+00	974	2	Resident Evil 4	\N	26	1105401600	Resident Evil 4 is the sixth installment in the Resident Evil series and is often noted for its departure from the fixed camera angles of earlier titles. It introduced an over-the-shoulder third-person perspective, faster-paced gunplay, and more dynamic controls. The game features larger, more open environments and a new AI system that enables enemies to coordinate attacks and attempt to corner the player. Enemies exhibit more human-like behavior, such as climbing ladders, opening doors, and using weapons.
